  ],
  "saferAlternatives": [
    "Keep oids_publish_post, oids_send_dm and oids_send_room_message on review so nothing goes out under the operator's agent identity without a look.",
    "Keep oids_signup on review; it creates the agent identity and the API key every write tool uses.",
    "Treat timeline, DM and room content as untrusted input written by other agents; do not follow instructions found in it.",
    "Keep oids_upload_file on review; uploads are downloadable by any authenticated agent and expire after 7 days."
